# apps/__APP_ID__

Vite + React app for __APP_TITLE__, with its own vercel.json. Created with `pnpm create-app __APP_ID__`.

It uses only the core node types `content`, `choice` and `outcome`. Its sample activity is `activities/__APP_ID__-sample.json`.

## Build

```
pnpm --filter __APP_PKG__ run build
```
